<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>We've issued a refund of {{ trigger.amount | default: "your payment" }} {{ trigger.currency | default: "" }}. How long it takes to appear depends on your bank or card provider.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you have questions about it, reply to this email.</mj-text>
